The [DoNotParallelizeAttribute](/en-us/dotnet/api/microsoft.visualstudio.testtools.unittesting.donotparallelizeattribute) prevents parallel execution for specific assemblies, classes, or methods. Use this attribute when tests share state or resources that can't be safely accessed concurrently.

